  <div class="hero-copy">
    <h1>One memory for every agent you'll ever use</h1>
    <p class="lead">Inspired by the human hippocampus, hippo saves what you teach one coding agent in your repo, and your other agents read it, so switching agents stops meaning starting over.</p>
