      <div class="rv"><dt>Does my code leave my machine?</dt><dd>Recall is offline by default, and text only leaves through settings you switch on, or <code>hippo sleep</code> when <code>ANTHROPIC_API_KEY</code> is set.</dd></div>
      <div class="rv"><dt>Do I still need CLAUDE.md or AGENTS.md?</dt><dd>Keep them for short standing rules. Let hippo hold the lessons.</dd></div>
